# Recall harness

`InitDocs/` is the initial idea, not the final spec. Canon: `.cursor/skills/recall-expert-harness/canon.md`. Development rules and test honesty apply to every plan and every code change.

## Planning trigger

If the user message contains `@recall:` or `@reacall:`, or asks for a project, milestone, phase, or feature plan:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/recall-expert-harness/SKILL.md` and follow `planning-chain.md`.
2. Launch all ten expert subagents in one parallel batch before writing the plan.
3. Publish each sign-off in full (verdict, confidence, notes, recommendations, options, alternatives, risks, push-back).
4. Do not hide dissent, and do not treat agreement as valid without a checked list.
5. Do not start implementation in that turn.

## Otherwise

Read the matching skill before editing that area. Also read `development-rules.md` and `test-honesty.md` before product code.

| Trigger | Skill |
|---|---|
| `@recall:`, `@reacall:`, plan, harness | `.cursor/skills/recall-expert-harness/SKILL.md` |
| Solution, DI, TFM, dependencies | `.cursor/skills/dotnet-architect/SKILL.md` |
| ONNX, MRL, ZVec, HNSW, RRF | `.cursor/skills/vectors-embeddings/SKILL.md` |
| Prefixes, languages, chunking, labels | `.cursor/skills/nlp/SKILL.md` |
| RIDs, watchers, iOS scan, model download | `.cursor/skills/maui-platform/SKILL.md` |
| Razor UI, copy, a11y | `.cursor/skills/ux-ui/SKILL.md` |
| Egress, telemetry, sync design | `.cursor/skills/privacy-local-first/SKILL.md` |
