| MkDocs, ADRs | `.cursor/skills/docs-mkdocs/SKILL.md` |

v1 stays local-only. User-facing copy ships in Arabic and English. New code uses enums or static classes instead of magic strings. Tests are honest: critical paths, hot paths, and edge cases. Line coverage of 60% at M1 and 70% later is a floor, not the verdict.
